    'Bread Project (per serve)',
    'Sandwiches',
    (select id from public.categories where alias = 'sandwiches'),
    'Catering Project''s signature lunch offering brings you a selection of gourmet sandwiches, mini wraps and mini sliders, packed with an assortment of fresh and delicious fillings flavours. Each serving includes 3 pieces, choose the quantity to suit your group size and preference. If you''re combining the bread project with a salad or other item, 1 serve per person will be plenty. On its own, we recommend 4-5 pieces per person (1.5 serves). If in doubt, contact our catering coordinators for assistance. Options Include (chef choice) - Triangle: Roasted Portobello Mushroom with lemon ricotta & pickled jalapeno chillies (V) - Triangle: Cali Veg Slaw with miso aioli, sprouts, mixed leaves & sunflower seeds (V) - Triangle: Beef Pastrami with russian coleslaw, pickles & fontina cheese - Triangle: Chunky Tuna, Avocado with lemon, chive mayonnaise & shaved fennel - Triangle: Roast Chicken with seeded mustard mayonnaise, avocado & rocket - Triangle: Smoked Ham with mushy peas, soft egg & piment d'' espelette - Mini Wrap: Falafel with kale and parsley tabbouleh, pickled turnip, red pepper & hummus & baba ganoush (VG/DF/V) - Mini Wrap: Poached chicken, cos, parmesan, bacon, parmesan & caesar dressing - Mini Wrap: Smoked ham with tomato, alfalfa & mustard aioli) - Mini Wrap: Spiced chicken schnitzel with slaw, pickles, iceberg lettuce and ranch dressing - Mini Wrap: Shaved turkey with cucumber, pickled red cabbage, spiced tomato kasundi & mixed leaves (DF) - Mini Slider: Free-Range Chicken, Mayonnaise, Lemon, Iceberg & Parsley - Mini Slider: Roasted Capsicum, Spinach, Hummus, Avocado & Feta (V) - Mini Slider: Jamon Serrano, Fig Jam, Rocket, Brie & Black Pepper - Mini Slider: Roasted Beef, Provolone, Pickled Pear, Avocado, Dijon Mustard Mayonnaise & Rocket Delivered chilled.',
