    'Order from our rice paper roll platters of 12 or 24 assorted mini rice paper rolls. Our rice paper rolls are roughly 7.5cm long The small rice paper roll platter includes: Vegetarian omelette, sweet chilli noodles, carrot, coriander, snowpeas, avocado & vietnamese mint (V/GF) (4) Vietnamese satay prawn, cucumber, mint & sweet chilli noodles (GF/DF)(4) BBQ lemongrass chicken, avocado, sweet chilli noodles, snowpeas, carrot & coriander (GF/DF) (4) Nuoc cham sauce (1) Soy, chilli & shallot sauce (1) The large rice paper roll platter includes: Vegetarian omelette, sweet chilli noodles, carrot, coriander, snowpeas, avocado & vietnamese mint (V/GF) (8) Vietnamese satay prawn, cucumber, mint & sweet chilli noodles (GF/DF) (8) BBQ lemongrass chicken, avocado, sweet chilli noodles, snowpeas, carrot & coriander (GF/DF) (8) Nuoc cham sauce (1) Soy, chilli & shallot sauce (1) Peanut & tamari sauce (1) \Delivered chilled.\',
