    '',
    'Place your order prior to 3pm for next day delivery; a 10% surcharge applies to all order received after this time. Late orders may not be accepted, or have the full choice of all menus items. For more details view our Delivery Info Page. Note: Our platters are fixed, to modify please order items individually instead. Image depicts large option Combination Rice Paper Roll Platter LunchFinger FoodPicnicsAfternoon TeaFinger FoodOccasionsKids PartiesMelbourne Cup CateringMovemberChristmasValentine''s DayInternational Women''s DayGluten FreeHalalFinger FoodKids PartyGrazing HGF ~~$59.45~~ $59.45 + GST Quantity Select Size Small Add to cart Related Products - [x] add to favorites remove from favorites $47.95 !Image 9: Miso Blackened Salmon Salad Platter View more [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/miso-blackened-salmon-salad-platter) Miso Blackened Salmon Salad Platter $47.95 DFGFNF $47.95 Click to Order Perfect for working lunches, corporate seminars or social occasions - our is Miso Blackened Salmon Salad is packed full of... Click to Order - [x] add to favorites remove from favorites $101.45 !Image 10: Finger Sandwich Platter View more [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/finger-sandwich-platter) Finger Sandwich Platter $101.45 $101.45 Add to cart Finger Sandwich PlatterPerfect for entertaining or impressing your clients, our traditionally delicious fingers sandwiches are... Add to cart - [x] add to favorites remove from favorites $87.45 !Image 11: Mini Taco Platter View more [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/mini-taco-platter) Mini Taco Platter $87.45 H $87.45 Add to cart Mini Taco PlatterOur Mini Tacos are roughly 6cm and 1 bite size- Chicken taco with smoked chipotle mayo, avocado and coriander... Add to cart - [x] add to favorites remove from favorites $283.95 !Image 12: Deluxe Sweet Treat Platter View more [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/deluxe-sweet-treat-platter) Deluxe Sweet Treat Platter $283.95 CN $283.95 Add to cart Deluxe Sweet Treat Platter Order our set platter of 56 pieces of your favourite brownies, lamingtons, cakes, donuts &... Add to cart NEXT DAY DELIVERY Scheduling made easy and stress-free. Available up until 5pm daily. FRESH SEASONAL INGREDIENTS Everyday, we source and cook the finest market fresh produce. UNCOMPROMISING SERVICE For us, it''s all in the detail. We take care of all of the finer points, so you don''t have to. EXQUISITE CULINARY BITES Flavour and texture that consistently impresses, whether it''s for 5 or 5,000+. ![Image 13: logo](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/) IT''S ALL IN THE DETAILS. CALL: 1300 078 888 EMAIL: orders@cateringproject.com.au Sydney Melbourne Brisbane ABOUT Contact Us About Us Delivery Create A Corporate Account My Account Blog LEGAL Orders & Shipping Policy Terms of Use Privacy Policy Refund Policy Subscribe to receive delicious weekly updates, access to exclusive deals, and more. Subscribe Catering Project supports the responsible service of alcohol. NSW Packaged Liquor Licence LIQO660038543 VIC Packaged Liquor Licence 36313558 PART OF THE J&CO GROUP Pomelo Catering Bowery Lane Koguma © 2026 Catering Project Powered by Flex Catering Follow Us [](https://www.facebook.com/cateringproject/) [](https://instagram.com/cateringproject) [](https://www.linkedin.com/company/cateringproject/) We Accept !Image 14 !Image 15 !Image 16 [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/combination-rice-paper-roll-platter#header) × Newsletter !Image 17: Loading... Your order/payment is being processed. Please don''t refresh or close the browser Adding to Cart × Search Form × Log in × Email Address Password Forgot Password? ContinueDon''t have an account? Sign up here. × Message × Are You Sure? Yes No Message × Are You Sure? YesNo × Your session has expired. Please log in to continue Continue Select Location × AllDeliveryPick Up !Image 18 Getting locations... Continue Group Order Details × Once you create a group order, you will be able to invite participants to add their items to the group order. When all participants have added their items, you will be able to finalise the order through the checkout. Delivery or Pick Up Date Time Add Time Name Email Address Max Order Amount per Person Description Create !Image 19: Loading...Group Order is being created. Please wait. Check if we deliver to you The Food You Love Delivered to Your Door Enter your postcode to check if we can deliver to your area. Check Now ![Image 20](https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=placeid:ChIJdWHTIWquEmsRIdnNCXufOyc) Catering Project Sydney 4.5 [](https://www.cateringproject.com.au/combination-rice-paper-roll-platter#) ishan sharma 17/05/2026 Excellent food, nicely packed and arrived on time.. highly recommend. T1nyPerson 11/05/2026 I brought the ALL DAY GRAZING PLATTER for MOTHERS DAY! Honestly, it was absolutely delicious, between Mum and myself we managed to almost finish it within 8 hrs. Highly recommended 👌 as this company are truly amazing, 🙌 without a doubt the prices are reasonable, the amount of food and variety with these platters are brilliant 👏. I couldn''t have got mum a present any better than this!! Keep up the great work, as ill definitely be ordering from here again in the future. Lucian Roban 23/04/2026 What the helly? Ordered 2 fruit platter for a funeral, says serves 3-5 people, the small one. Deceiving photo on website, they use the big platter for the small one as well. In the package i received like 1 orange, 1 kiwi, 1 grape vine and 1 passion fruit, That''s max 5 dollars. for 52 dollars and plus 45 dollars delivery, PURE ROBBERY ! I fully regret buying it. Cassidy H 30/03/2026 Amazing experience! Second time using the catering project for a work function- such gorgeous food and the service is TOP TIER Thankyou! Elsis Morejon 27/03/2026 The plated sit down package was so delicious! CP looked after dietary needs of my guests, Chef finalised the plating in our kitchen, waiter was excellent and they cleaned up afterwards! It made our experience quite memorable. We host for our stakeholders every year. Always exceptional food. Thank you CP Team! Andrew Lim 26/03/2026 For corporate or event catering in Sydney, CP offer reliable delivery, excellent presentation, and good dietary flexibility. Pricing sits on the higher end but the quality justifies it. Worth a call. Gavin Jones 26/03/2026 In a world of generic party platters, this catering is a total game-changer. I recently used them for a gathering and was blown away by the balance of whimsy and high-end culinary execution. The hot cross buns were pillowy and perfectly spiced, but the real showstopper was the presentation—it felt less like a ''delivery'' and more like a curated Easter garden on my table. If you want to actually enjoy your own party instead of sweating in the kitchen, this is the gold standard. Wendy Smith 26/03/2026 Highly recommended - catering ALWAYS on time, even to Sydney CBD, hot insulated packs supplied for hot food. And always high quality. Treats are so special. Christine Marsden 25/03/2026 Reliable, predictable and on time. You couldn''t want more from a caterer. Especially as they also cater for dietary requirements perfectly. Candice K CandiceK 25/03/2026 I’ve been to my fair share of office events where the highlight is… leaving early. Not this time. Catering Project Sydney completely raised the bar. The food was next-level—fresh, beautifully presented, and dangerously easy to keep going back for “just one more” (I lost count around five). And the service? Seamless. The team made everything feel effortless, like they’d quietly mastered the art of being everywhere at once without ever being intrusive. If this is office catering now, I suddenly have a lot more enthusiasm for work events. Sandy Bruns 25/03/2026 We had a school reunion event and the catering Project boxes were perfect! We were able to put them out straight on the table without having to transfer them onto to our own platters, which made it so easy and they looked and tasted beautiful Eva N 25/03/2026 Paulina Wade 25/03/2026 Delicious and well-presented food, and they have many options to choose from. The only issue is that they brought our order a little over an hour early. Since we work on a university campus, we were on the opposite side of campus and had to stop working early to get to the location of our meeting. Better early than late, though. Would recommend to anyone. Pickle Patricia 14/03/2026 Food was absolutely delicious, service and delivery was great. Only thing important to note is the cost is huge for the amount of food you get. $600 for two sandwich platters, one kids ham and cheese platter, sushi and fruit platter. The quantity in each platter is quite small for what you pay. Just something to note if you wish to order! Julian Lonsdale 17/08/2025 Catering Project is outstanding! Their service is super reliable, friendly, and professional. The team goes above and beyond to make every event seamless and help with getting things right and done at times with a vety short turn around time! Their catering options are excellent - delicious, beautifully presented, and perfectly tailored. I couldn’t recommend them more highly. Thanks Bianca! Google Rating 4.5 !Image 21 Loading...',
