    'Designed to feed two adults and two kids, this hamper is filled with gourmet, locally sourced produce and sweet goods. Complete with a stunning Pelli cooler bag and picnic rug, providing everything you need for the perfect day out. Our Family Picnic Hamper Includes: - Tart: Beetroot, caramelised onion, labneh & chive (2) - Slider: Panko crumbed prawn brioche , sriracha mayo, pickled cabbage & snow pea (2) - Grazing: Yarra Valley Hubert''s cows milk wash rind, pork & pistachio terrine, chicken pate, quince paste, Alto artisian mixed olives, Bresola, Fennel & chilli Capacola, pickles (1) - Extnatural crackers, virgin olive oil & sea salt crackers, rosemary & pecan valley seed crisps (1) - Salad: Junee lamb rump, green beans, snow pea tendrils, pickled onions, watermelon radish & pistachio salsa verde (1) - Salad: Heirloom tomato & seeded ciabatta bread, citrus, fresh basil, radicchio & sherry dressing (1) - Finger: Ham & cheese (2) tomato & cheese (2) - Sweets: Strawberry mousse & chocolate ice cream pops (2) Raspberry & butter cream macarons (3) Strawberry & white chocolate dipped strawberries (2) - Sweets: Marshmallow & strawberry skewers (4) chocolate eggs - Serious popcorn (2) - The Patriarch Pinot Noir Chardonnay NV (1) - Picnic Rug (1) - Pelli Cooler Bag (1) - Disposables: Cutlery Pack (4) - Disposables: 9" Sugarcane round disposable plate (4) - Disposables: 8oz Single Wall Paper Cups (4) Delivered chilled.',
